              "text": "In *The Vampire Diaries*, Elena Gilbert turns into a vampire across two closely connected episodes spanning the end of Season 3 and the beginning of Season 4:\n\n### 1. The Transition: Season 3, Episode 22 \u2014 \"The Departed\"\n* **What happens:** Earlier in the day, Dr. Meredith Fell secretly gives Elena vampire blood (specifically Damon\u2019s blood) to cure a severe brain hemorrhage. Later in the episode, Elena and Matt Donovan are driving when Rebekah Mikaelson stands in the middle of Wickery Bridge, causing Matt to swerve and crash the truck into the water. \n* Stefan Salvatore arrives to save them, but Elena selflessly signals him to rescue an unconscious Matt first. By the time Stefan returns for her, **Elena has drowned and died with vampire blood in her system**. \n* The episode ends with Elena suddenly waking up gasping for air on a slab in the morgue, having entered the transition phase.\n\n### 2. The Full Transformation: Season 4, Episode 1 \u2014 \"Growing Pains\"\n* **What happens:** In order to complete the transition and become a vampire rather than die permanently, Elena must feed on human blood within 24 hours. \n* After struggling with the decision and being captured by the Town Council, Stefan helps Elena get access to blood. She **drinks human blood, completing her transition** and officially becoming a vampire.",
